Description: SupraLINUX system and desktop defaults
 Development settings package for the SupraLINUX Aurora baseline.
 .
 It owns persistent SupraLINUX defaults and small integration shims that must
 survive rebuilds. The initial implementation configures the SDDM greeter to
 run on KWin Wayland using KDE's supported Plasma integration path and keeps
 Plasma-visible integration behavior functional on the Ubuntu 26.04 base.
